WEBVTT

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.200
<i>I've tried not to think about it all this time.</i>

00:00:14.510 --> 00:00:16.990
<i>About how Poco is really a tanuki.</i>

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:26.080
<b>Takamatsu Festival</b>

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:28.640
<i>Poco is human.</i>

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.090
<i>I tried to convince myself of that.</i>

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:34.470
<i>But it was always nagging at 
me in the back of my mind.</i>

00:00:35.270 --> 00:00:37.900
<i>Why did Poco take a human form</i>

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:39.600
<i>and show himself to me?</i>

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.760
<i>And I was always afraid of what</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.000
<i>would happen if everyone found 
out the truth about him...</i>

00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:47.560
Go bye-bye...

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:49.480
Go bye-bye!

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:51.660
Poco!

00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:02.660
<b>Poco's Udon World</b>

00:02:21.950 --> 00:02:24.160
Episode 12: "Kakeudon"

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:25.910
Poco!

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:33.170
Poco-chan...

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:35.250
Poco! Wait!

00:02:36.820 --> 00:02:37.550
Poco!

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:40.830
Poco!

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:43.070
You don't have to run!

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:44.880
It's okay!

00:02:44.880 --> 00:02:46.310
I'll protect you for the rest of my life!

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:50.060
So don't go!

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:52.020
Poco!

00:02:58.180 --> 00:02:59.190
Souta...

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:01.120
Ouch...

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:04.980
Souta!

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:07.070
Poco!

00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:08.300
Souta...

00:03:12.630 --> 00:03:16.250
Poco, let's stay together. Forever.

00:03:17.410 --> 00:03:20.880
You're family now. My family.

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:36.340
<b>Udon</b>

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:38.280
<b>Udon</b>

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:45.330
Why?

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:49.320
What is this?

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:53.420
Are you showing me this?

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:05.270
Poco... You...

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:10.840
There are stories of a shapeshifting 
tanuki appearing in these parts.

00:04:11.180 --> 00:04:15.030
They say that the tanuki 
takes on a human appearance,

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:18.630
and lives in the form of a 
child for years and years.

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:26.860
Do you want to eat this?

00:04:27.150 --> 00:04:28.280
It's all yours.

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:40.800
Look out!

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:42.010
That's...

00:05:19.470 --> 00:05:23.380
Poco... Are you that same tanuki?

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:33.770
Where did Souta-san go?

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:35.870
Where's Poco-chan?

00:05:35.870 --> 00:05:39.770
It's a big crowd. I hope he didn't get lost.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.700
Probably just went to the bathroom.

00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:45.780
Maybe I'll go, too.

00:05:45.780 --> 00:05:46.570
Me, too.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:51.010
From the first time I saw that child,

00:05:51.770 --> 00:05:53.860
I sensed something strange...

00:06:13.920 --> 00:06:15.530
Do be careful.

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:19.160
If a child wanders around here alone,

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.240
a tanuki could bewitch them.

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:23.720
Oh...

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:25.920
Due to my work,

00:06:26.560 --> 00:06:29.180
I have an interest in the 
supernatural, you see.

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:30.670
Supernatural?

00:06:30.670 --> 00:06:31.990
What are you tryin' to say?

00:06:32.610 --> 00:06:33.710
Please,

00:06:34.380 --> 00:06:36.950
watch over Souta-san.

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:39.750
Don't gotta tell me that.

00:06:44.780 --> 00:06:48.300
Poco... Why do you show me all these things?

00:06:48.820 --> 00:06:51.260
Daddy, love Souta.

00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:52.260
Huh?

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:54.030
Love you!

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:56.140
What's this all of a sudden?

00:06:59.010 --> 00:07:03.730
The driver said you came 
runnin' out into the street...

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:07.170
What were you doin'?

00:07:08.410 --> 00:07:10.580
I... The accident...

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:12.410
I don't remember anything.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:13.600
Huh?!

00:07:13.600 --> 00:07:16.080
What do you mean?! 
Do you remember me?!

00:07:16.080 --> 00:07:16.990
What about me?!

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:19.590
No, I meant...

00:07:20.070 --> 00:07:23.920
I can't really remember anything 
from the time of the accident...

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:27.940
We'll have them scan ya again!

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:31.180
Dad said he'd be here after the 
restaurant's closed for the day.

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:32.920
It's fine!

00:07:32.920 --> 00:07:35.230
He's gotta work bright and early tomorrow, too.

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:36.680
I'm sure he's got prep work to do, too.

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:38.000
But...

00:07:38.390 --> 00:07:40.100
You've been leavin' work early

00:07:40.400 --> 00:07:43.460
to come to the hospital 
all this time, haven't you?

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:46.990
I don't wanna cause trouble for your work.

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:50.570
Don't worry about me. It's no big deal.

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:51.860
It <i>is</i> a big deal!

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:56.700
You could've died.

00:07:57.620 --> 00:08:01.350
You're always thinkin' of others like that...

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:02.640
bein' considerate...

00:08:03.610 --> 00:08:07.040
You could put yourself first 
at times like this, at least!

00:08:15.400 --> 00:08:16.190
Dad?

00:08:22.970 --> 00:08:23.690
Dad!

00:08:24.230 --> 00:08:25.090
Listen...

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.490
I found somethin' I wanna do, too.

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:34.180
What's this about technical school in Tokyo?

00:08:34.180 --> 00:08:36.510
I won't be an inconvenience to you.

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:39.710
I'll get a job an' pay the tuition myself.

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:42.010
That ain't what I'm sayin'!

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:46.260
Instead of goin' off to some strange school,

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:48.210
help with the restaurant!

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:52.950
No. I found somethin' I wanna do!

00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:56.530
No matter what you say, I'm goin' to Tokyo!

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:06.490
Do what ya want.

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:13.020
<i>That's right.</i>

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:15.570
<i>I hated Kagawa.</i>

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:18.290
<i>How our house smelled like soup stock.</i>

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:19.800
<i>And Dad...</i>

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:23.000
<i>How he'd just say, "Do what ya want," 
no matter what I told him.</i>

00:09:24.350 --> 00:09:27.550
<i>But meeting Poco helped me 
remember all these things...</i>

00:09:28.090 --> 00:09:30.530
<i>So now, I wish</i>

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:34.230
<i>I'd made the effort to really 
talk things over with him...</i>

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:39.410
<i>There's so much I should have told him.</i>

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:42.070
It's okay.

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:45.270
Daddy loves Souta.

00:09:45.650 --> 00:09:48.210
But what do you mean by...

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:54.150
<b>Udon Makes a Comeback!</b>

00:09:50.150 --> 00:09:54.150
Dad, this is the kind of work Souta does.

00:09:55.810 --> 00:09:58.160
I can't make heads or tails of that stuff.

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:01.920
I'll pour us some tea.

00:10:14.920 --> 00:10:16.870
Amazin', ain't it?

00:10:16.870 --> 00:10:18.460
Souta said he made that.

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:21.990
I don't understand it, but...

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:24.680
He's doin' us proud.

00:10:26.100 --> 00:10:27.030
Dad...

00:10:27.680 --> 00:10:29.840
really felt that way?

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:31.870
Uh-huh.

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:36.310
I wish I'd really talked to him.

00:10:36.890 --> 00:10:40.880
I wish I'd told him that I found 
my calling, the same as him...

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:48.830
<i>Dad made udon,</i>

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:51.610
<i>and the people who ate it loved it.</i>

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:54.290
<i>I saw how happy that made him,</i>

00:10:54.840 --> 00:10:58.010
<i>and I felt like I could learn so much from that.</i>

00:10:58.670 --> 00:11:01.800
<i>I decided to go to Tokyo because 
I wanted to follow his example,</i>

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:03.720
<i>but I couldn't get that across to him...</i>

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:07.460
<i>I left home like I couldn't get out of there 
fast enough, and I didn't even call...</i>

00:11:15.680 --> 00:11:16.580
Dad?

00:11:18.170 --> 00:11:19.660
I knew...

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:23.370
That you'd found your own calling.

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:27.910
I'm sorry I left so much unsaid.

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:30.930
No... I'm the one who left things unsaid!

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.580
If I'd just talked to you more...

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:37.980
But I ran off to Tokyo and then got 
completely absorbed in my work...

00:11:38.870 --> 00:11:40.830
I never even thought about how you felt...

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:42.750
That's as it should be.

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:51.170
I loved your udon.

00:11:51.920 --> 00:11:53.420
The smell of the soup stock, too.

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:57.040
I know I'll never be able 
to eat it again, but still...

00:11:58.070 --> 00:12:00.580
I wish I could eat your udon one last time...

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:07.970
This is Dad's...

00:12:07.970 --> 00:12:08.640
Uh-huh.

00:12:16.880 --> 00:12:18.130
<b>To Souta</b>

00:12:19.250 --> 00:12:21.630
You wrote this for me?

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:26.400
Dad...

00:13:12.730 --> 00:13:15.390
<b>To Souta</b>

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:19.840
I'm always watchin'.

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:27.820
Dad!

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:31.950
Daddy loves Souta!

00:13:32.800 --> 00:13:33.650
Poco...

00:13:34.340 --> 00:13:37.710
You showed yourself to me 
so you could tell me that?

00:13:40.590 --> 00:13:41.710
Really?

00:13:42.030 --> 00:13:42.690
Uh-huh.

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:44.930
Poco...

00:13:45.640 --> 00:13:49.600
I love Souta, too. Love you lots!

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:52.600
Me, too. I love you.

00:13:52.600 --> 00:13:55.600
Together. Always together!

00:13:55.940 --> 00:13:57.980
Yeah. We'll always be together.

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:04.490
Poco?

00:14:05.120 --> 00:14:06.410
No, no!

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:09.420
What's wrong?!

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:19.080
Poco! Where are you going, Poco?!

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.500
Poco... Wait! Don't go!

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:23.600
Poco!

00:14:24.140 --> 00:14:25.260
Please...

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:27.880
Let's stay together forever!

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:28.980
Poco!

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:32.810
Love Souta.

00:14:33.170 --> 00:14:35.270
Always together!

00:14:35.860 --> 00:14:38.020
I know. So together, let's...

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:43.250
Rin, Nakaji, Daddy, Mommy...

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:47.400
Everyone loves Souta. Loves Souta lots.

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:51.300
Together. Everyone, always together.

00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:54.660
In here.

00:14:57.110 --> 00:14:58.160
In here...

00:14:58.410 --> 00:15:02.240
Always together. Always!

00:15:09.310 --> 00:15:10.230
Poco...

00:15:20.950 --> 00:15:23.720
Oh, the man from Tawara-san's place.

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:25.360
Hello.

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:26.400
Hello.

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:28.400
What brings you here today?

00:15:28.750 --> 00:15:30.830
I was hoping to speak to your brother.

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:33.900
Oh, he's upstairs. Go on in.

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:35.850
Thank you.

00:15:38.870 --> 00:15:41.540
I was expecting you to come by.

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:42.780
Um...

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:46.550
Did you know the truth about Poco?

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:50.780
I hear it takes an extraordinary amount

00:15:50.780 --> 00:15:53.190
of power for a tanuki to take human form.

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:58.670
He must have really wanted 
to meet you, despite that.

00:15:59.510 --> 00:16:01.380
And to communicate to you...

00:16:02.590 --> 00:16:05.550
that even when a family 
is physically separated,

00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:07.190
they will always be together.

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:19.060
Yeah... We'll never be apart.

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:25.010
I see... Then you've made up your mind.

00:16:25.010 --> 00:16:28.710
I'm truly sorry for being 
so indecisive all this time.

00:16:29.150 --> 00:16:31.230
But I finally have a clear view of what I want.

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:34.970
I'm going to give it my best shot 
here in Kagawa after all.

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:38.850
Got it. I'll send some work 
your way now and again.

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:39.720
<b>Resignation</b>

00:16:39.250 --> 00:16:40.580
Don't go soft!

00:16:40.580 --> 00:16:43.580
Souta-san, please make udon again.

00:16:43.580 --> 00:16:45.100
I'll be coming over to hang out!

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:47.100
Sure. I'll be waiting.

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:54.610
We heard from Dahama-kun.

00:16:54.980 --> 00:16:58.740
Souta-kun, we look forward 
to having you on board.

00:16:59.100 --> 00:17:01.430
It will be my pleasure to work with you.

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:04.870
<b>Sanuki Udon</b>

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:04.870
One large order of bukkake udon, 
coming right up!

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:07.980
It's too bad. You loved him so much.

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:08.880
Eitarou, you'll fall!

00:17:08.730 --> 00:17:09.960
Don't you miss him?

00:17:08.880 --> 00:17:09.960
Udon!

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:11.960
No.

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:14.130
I'm all right. Even if we're apart, 
it feels like he's still with me.

00:17:14.530 --> 00:17:18.340
You're right. Maybe that's 
what it means to be family.

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:17.720
Okay, up you go.

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:20.600
Here, I'll feed you.

00:17:20.600 --> 00:17:23.650
Nozomi will leave one day to get married,

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:23.650
Here, say "ahh."

00:17:23.650 --> 00:17:27.170
but I'll have to send her off with a smile.

00:17:25.990 --> 00:17:26.830
Is it yummy?

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:28.300
Udon!

00:17:28.070 --> 00:17:28.900
Yeah.

00:17:29.230 --> 00:17:31.280
Will I get to play with Poco-chan again?

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:34.400
You bet.

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:36.410
Yay!

00:17:35.730 --> 00:17:36.410
'ay!

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:40.010
Play date with Poco-chan! 
Play date with Poco-chan!

00:17:41.170 --> 00:17:45.170
<i>Dad... I'm going to live my life here in Kagawa.</i>

00:17:45.850 --> 00:17:47.420
<i>I took a roundabout way here, but...</i>

00:17:48.190 --> 00:17:51.000
<i>I love Kagawa.</i>

00:17:54.550 --> 00:17:56.830
Souta, food's ready!

00:17:57.830 --> 00:17:59.600
I started without ya.

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:01.310
You made this, Sis?

00:18:01.630 --> 00:18:04.680
Impressed? I've been practicin'.

00:18:04.920 --> 00:18:07.610
Hey, your cooking's gotten pretty good.

00:18:07.610 --> 00:18:10.690
I know, right? Souta, you eat up, too.

00:18:10.980 --> 00:18:11.700
Yeah.

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:13.460
Oh, I almost forgot.

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:16.780
Hiroshi-kun sent the photos from the festival.

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:18.950
He took a ton of them.

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:21.450
And they're all of Rinko.

00:18:28.710 --> 00:18:30.830
They really are all of her.

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:33.250
He's something else.

00:18:34.060 --> 00:18:37.050
But Poco-chan isn't in a single one.

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:43.430
Hiroshi-kun said, "Tell the little guy I'm sorry."

00:18:44.480 --> 00:18:46.680
Poco wouldn't get mad over somethin' like that.

00:18:46.990 --> 00:18:49.440
So wrong! Ya sound so wrong with an accent!

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:51.440
He sure does!

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:53.280
What're you talkin' about... Er...

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:57.030
That reminds me.

00:18:58.220 --> 00:19:00.270
I got this developed today.

00:19:03.710 --> 00:19:05.090
Poco-chan!

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:08.110
So ya did take a photo of him?

00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:08.850
Look.

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:13.540
By chance, when I found Dad's camera.

00:19:13.810 --> 00:19:16.480
Poco-chan really is adorable.

00:19:16.480 --> 00:19:19.680
I know this one will be a 
cutie like Poco-chan, too.

00:19:19.680 --> 00:19:21.930
Like Poco? That don't make sense.

00:19:22.150 --> 00:19:24.050
Huh? Really?

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:25.970
You're really somethin'.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:33.000
<b>Tawara Noodles</b>

00:19:31.870 --> 00:19:35.320
<b>Tawara Noodles</b>

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:43.120
<i>To me, the smell of soup stock</i>

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:45.950
<b>To Souta</b>

00:19:47.160 --> 00:19:49.200
<i>is the smell of the house at twilight.</i>

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:53.240
<i>The smell of my dad.</i>

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:01.640
<i>A smell that wafts deep into my nostrils...</i>

00:19:59.970 --> 00:20:07.890
<b>Tawara Noodles</b>

00:20:02.380 --> 00:20:03.950
<i>The smell of family.</i>

00:21:41.680 --> 00:21:43.630
It turned up again!

00:21:43.630 --> 00:21:44.280
Huh?

00:21:46.810 --> 00:21:48.190
Gran'ma!

00:21:52.030 --> 00:21:53.290
Granny?

00:21:53.520 --> 00:21:58.040
I'm sorry. I guess a baby tanuki's 
been making a mess of our field.

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:04.160
Today's the day I'll make me that tanuki soup.

00:22:04.160 --> 00:22:05.460
Gran'ma!

00:22:05.460 --> 00:22:08.510
It's fine. It's just a little one.

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:11.310
It can't do much harm.

00:22:11.310 --> 00:22:13.950
Where'd that varmint go?!

00:22:14.260 --> 00:22:15.920
I'm so sorry!

00:22:17.110 --> 00:22:19.030
Yayoi, come on now!

00:22:19.030 --> 00:22:20.520
